  _cardName: "Mercado de Cr\xE9ditos de Carbono Industrial"
  _description: "Empresas compram e vendem permiss\xE3o de emitir carbono entre si.
    Modelo real: o mercado europeu EU ETS e o de Calif\xF3rnia \u2014 move muito
    dinheiro, mas a cr\xEDtica documentada e conhecida: cr\xE9dito de compensa\xE7\xE3o
    nem sempre significa polui\xE7\xE3o a menos de verdade."
  _cardNameEn: Industrial Carbon Credit Market
  _descriptionEn: "Companies buy and sell permission to emit carbon among themselves.
    Real model: the European EU ETS and California's market \u2014 moves a lot of
    money, but the documented, well-known criticism stands: an offset credit doesn't
    always mean real pollution reduction."
